<title>UK: BAe declines comment on Boeing merger.</title>
<headline>BAe declines comment on Boeing merger.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-12-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>British Aerospace declined to comment on the merger of Boeing Co and McDonnell Douglas of the U.S., announced on Sunday.</p>
<p>Shares in British Aerospace sank in London trading, falling 8p to 1117-1/2p.</p>
<p>--London newsroom +44 171 542 4027</p>
</text>
